WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.937
Step 5.

00:00:01.887 --> 00:00:04.050
The procurement chain.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:09.737
ArriveCAN cost 93 million for a questionnaire estimated at 80 thousand.

00:00:09.737 --> 00:00:15.050
Phoenix Pay cost 9.3 billion — a 3000 percent overrun.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:21.475
GCStrategies helped write the requirements for a 25 million dollar contract they then won.

00:00:21.475 --> 00:00:25.437
Officials could not prove work was completed before payment.
